  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the raclette grill to 375 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "In a large bowl, mix together lamb, red chilli, onion, garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, and salt",
    "Divide the mixture into 8 equal parts and shape each part into a nigiri shape",
    "Place the shaped lamb mixture on the raclette grill and cook for 10 minutes",
    "Flip the lamb and cook for an additional 10 minutes",
    "Serve the lamb hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley",
    "Repeat the layers of lamb and parsley to create a dense and earthy dish",
    "Cook for an additional 10 minutes to allow the flavors to meld together"
  ],
